
## Lab 01: OT/IT 망 분리 구축

### 1. 토폴로지
- **OT-Core-SW (3560 Multilayer Switch)**: VLAN 10(OT), VLAN 20(IT) 라우팅
- **OT-SW (2960 Switch)**: OT PC 2대 연결
- **IT-SW (2960 Switch)**: IT PC 2대 연결
- **IP 대역**
    - OT: 192.168.10.0/24 (Gateway: 192.168.10.1)
    - IT: 10.0.0.0/24 (Gateway: 10.0.0.1)

### 2. 핵심 설정

**OT-Core-SW (3560)**
```cisco
vlan 10
 name OT
vlan 20
 name IT
!
interface vlan 10
 ip address 192.168.10.1 255.255.255.0
 no shutdown
!
interface vlan 20
 ip address 10.0.0.1 255.255.255.0
 no shutdown
!
interface fa0/10
 switchport mode access
 switchport access vlan 10
!
interface fa0/20
 switchport access vlan 20
!
ip routing
